{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38967","headline":"送友人宰浔阳 · 杜荀鹤","name":"送友人宰浔阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高兴那言去路长，非君不解爱浔阳。\n有时猨鸟来公署，到处烟霞是道乡。\n钓艇满江鱼贱菜，纸窑连岳楮多桑。\n陶潜旧隐依稀在，好继高踪结草堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}